TRAITDEF AXE
    IFPREVERB EXAMINE -1
        ECHO PLAYER A sturdy hafted weapon with a heavy, sharpened head designed for powerful chopping blows.
    ENDIF
ENDTRAIT

TRAITDEF BATTLEAXE
    IFPREVERB EXAMINE -1
        ECHO PLAYER A large, heavy axe with a broad cutting head and long haft, built for powerful two-handed swings.
    ENDIF
ENDTRAIT

TRAITDEF DAGGER
    IFPREVERB EXAMINE -1
        ECHO PLAYER A short, sharply pointed blade suited to quick thrusts, close fighting, and precise cuts.
    ENDIF
ENDTRAIT

